  "idea": "Calibre: the ultimate free eBook manager and format converter",
  "text": "How to read any study guide or manual on any device for free. Reading dense two-column PDFs on a smartphone screen forces you to zoom and scroll horizontally. Static page dimensions cannot reflow text dynamically, creating painful reading friction across smaller mobile viewports. Calibre converts rigid document layers into responsive EPUBs, automatically adapting font sizes and margins for mobile screens. Turn unreadable training manuals into fluid pocket guides in seconds.",
